# Wave W17-H (Route 37): bell post — a wayside bell post of the old road, a small bronze bell hung under a crossbar, rung for travellers in the tower’s hearing, on pod turf (fully opaque, ground baked in). The design walks the last stretch by Lantern’s bells; the road answers with its own.
